{
    "title": "Kura Sushi Rewards",
    "description": "\u2022 The NEW and improved Kura Sushi Rewards loyalty app is here! \r\n\u2022 With Kura Revolving Sushi Bar\u2019s NEW rewards app, you\u2019ll receive promotional coupons, earn points for your purchases, and access your local Kura Revolving Sushi Bar waitlist, remotely!\r\n\u2022 Receive 300 bonus points when you sign up or migrate your existing Kura Sushi account to the new Kura Sushi Rewards app.\r\n\r\nEARN MORE REWARDS\r\n\u2022 Earn 10 points for every $1 spent in the restaurant or online at order.kurasushi.com and receive 300 bonus points when you sign up or migrate your account.\r\n\u2022 Automatically unlock a $5 Reward* at 500 points!\r\n\u2022 500 points automatically unlocks a $5 Reward*. \r\n\u2022 Birthday Reward** - Receive a complimentary dessert on your birthday when you dine in. Choose from: Taiyaki Ice Cream, Japanese Style Soy Milk Donuts and Mochi Ice Cream.\r\n\r\nJOIN THE WAITLIST REMOTELY\r\n\u2022 Browse locations, check operating hours and get directions.\r\n\u2022 View live wait times and join the waitlist remotely.\r\n\u2022 Get notified via email or SMS when it\u2019s almost your turn. Message and data rates may apply.\r\n\u2022 Check your estimated wait time and place in line.\r\n\r\nPROMOTIONAL OFFERS\r\n\u2022 Get 300 Bonus Points for signing-up or for migrating your account from the previous Kura Sushi app.\r\n\u2022 Earn $5 Rewards for every $50 you spend.\r\n\u2022 Plus a complimentary dessert** for your birthday!\r\n\r\nORDER ONLINE\r\n\u2022 Access our online ordering platform on the app\r\n\u2022 View the menu, place your order and redeem rewards, right from the Kura Rewards App!\r\n\r\n\r\n*One (1) $5 Reward can be used with a minimum $15 purchase (before tax and tip). Up to two (2) $5 Rewards can be used in a single transaction with a minimum $30 purchase. May not be combined with Birthday Reward.\r\n\r\n**Birthday Reward valid for dine in only. Cannot be combined with any other coupon or discount. Limit (1) Birthday Reward discount per transaction.",
